Alembic migrations for the FoodFlow schema (app/models.py).

  cd backend
  DATABASE_URL=postgresql://... alembic upgrade head      # apply (use the direct port 5432 URL on Supabase)
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change" # after editing app/models.py

Demo mode (DEMO_MODE=true on SQLite) still builds the schema itself and resets it on model changes.
